{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05166","headline":"秋夜陪张丞相赵侍御游㴩湖二首 二 · 尹懋","name":"秋夜陪张丞相赵侍御游㴩湖二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上饶奇山，漓罗云水间。\n风和树色杂，苔古石文斑。\n巴俗将千溠，㴩湖凡几湾。\n嬉游竟不尽，乘月泛舟还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹懋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}